    "de": [
      "Orelle besteht aus einem Dutzend kleiner Weiler, die voller bemerkenswerter kleiner Elemente sind!"
    ],
    "en": [
      "Orelleis made of 8 hamlets, which are full of small local heritage: small streets with oratories, chapels ,fountains, a rich discovery ride awaits you!"
    ],
    "it": [
